// Rigetti - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# Rigetti's Quil dialect. Quil has no output operation at all -- it
# returns quantum states -- so the greeting "Hello World!" is carried
# as a declared classical register rather than printed.
DECLARE greeting BIT[12]
